# Copy to mobile/.fvmrc and set ONE explicit Flutter SDK version for this repo.
# Do not leave this unset. Do not rely on a global flutter install.
#
# Example (replace with the version your team agrees on):
# 3.24.5
#
# Then from repo root:
#   make install-tools CONFIRM=yes
#   make setup
#
# Maintainers: change the pin deliberately (PR + team notice), then:
#   cd mobile && fvm use <new-version> --force
#   git add .fvmrc .fvm/fvm_config.json
#
# This example file is NOT a pin — Make will fail until mobile/.fvmrc exists.
